  "tip": "<p>Map the requirement to minimize <i>RPO</i> and speed <i>RTO</i> to native features. Prefer <i>point in time recovery</i> for transactional databases and service native <i>backups</i> for distributed stores, and remember that replication improves availability but does not protect against corruption or deletes.</p>",
